# LF for every text file, on every host. The VM runs the tools, scripts and heredocs as they
# are checked out, and a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would hand it CRLF: a broken
# shebang, `bash\r` not found. PowerShell reads LF scripts fine, so .ps1 stays LF too.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.iso binary
